-1. Set $grid_y = \text{voxels\_on\_y}$.
-2. Calculate $grid_x = \lceil \frac{voxels\_on\_y}{size_y} \times size_x \rceil$.
-3. Calculate $grid_z = \lceil \frac{voxels\_on\_y}{size_y} \times size_z \rceil$.
